      ],
      "priority": "high",
      "details": "Create a CIFParser class in the IO module that can read CIF files and extract relevant crystallographic information. Implement methods to parse unit cell parameters, atomic positions, symmetry operations, and metadata. Handle common CIF format variations and error conditions gracefully. Convert parsed data into the CrystalStructure objects defined in task 1.",
      "testStrategy": "Test with a variety of CIF files from different sources, including simple and complex structures. Verify correct extraction of all required parameters. Compare parsed results with known values from the original files."
