      "description": "Develop core algorithms for detecting and analyzing symmetry operations within crystal structures.",
      "status": "pending",
      "dependencies": [
        1
      ],
      "priority": "high",
      "details": "Create algorithms to identify symmetry elements (rotation axes, mirror planes, inversion centers) in crystal structures. Implement functions to determine point groups and space groups based on detected symmetry operations. Use established crystallographic algorithms and mathematical approaches. Ensure numerical stability and appropriate tolerance handling for floating-point comparisons.",
      "testStrategy": "Test with well-characterized crystal structures with known symmetry properties. Verify correct identification of symmetry elements and space groups. Include edge cases like structures with special positions or high symmetry."
    },
