      "dependencies": [
        1
      ],
      "priority": "medium",
      "details": "Extend the CrystalStructure class to support the introduction of point defects, particularly vacancies. Implement methods to remove atoms at specific positions, create substitutional defects, and generate supercells with controlled defect concentrations. Ensure proper handling of atomic indices and positions after defect introduction.",
      "testStrategy": "Test defect creation with various crystal structures. Verify that atomic positions and counts are correctly updated. Check that supercell generation with defects maintains proper periodicity and structure."
    },
